TI  - Towards Responsible Urban Geospatial AI: Insights From the White and Grey Literatures
T2  - JOURNAL OF GEOVISUALIZATION AND SPATIAL ANALYSIS
LA  - English
KW  - Geospatial AI
KW  - Responsible AI
KW  - GeoAI integration
