TI  - UrbanXplain: A Language-Driven Urban Planning System with Explainable Reasoning and Real-Time 3D Rendering
T2  - 33RD ACM SIGSPATIAL INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON ADVANCES IN GEOGRAPHIC INFORMATION SYSTEMS, ACM SIGSPATIAL 2025
LA  - English
