TI  - Understanding city dynamics by analyzing investment processes-an integrated formal and semantic approach
T2  - LAND USE POLICY
LA  - English
KW  - Urban analytics
KW  - GeoAI
KW  - Building permits
KW  - Unsupervised learning
KW  - Clustering
KW  - Natural language processing
