TI  - Spectral Input Selection and Architectural Design for Robust Multispectral Land Cover Semantic Segmentation from Sentinel-2 Imagery
T2  - AI
LA  - English
KW  - multispectral feature analysis
KW  - Sentinel-2 data
KW  - deep neural networks
KW  - cross-regional generalization
KW  - geospatial artificial intelligence
KW  - land use
KW  - remote sensing
KW  - CLASSIFICATION
